WEBVTT

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.059
it might have unintended consequences

00:17:00.083 --> 00:17:02.601
for a whole series
of negotiations in the future.

00:17:02.625 --> 00:17:03.643
(Upbeat music)

00:17:03.667 --> 00:17:08.101
In 2017, Jason became
the general manager of the Buffalo Sabres.

00:17:08.125 --> 00:17:11.018
He's one of the youngest NHL GMs ever,

00:17:11.042 --> 00:17:13.893
and he attributes
a lot of his success to his shift

00:17:13.917 --> 00:17:16.083
in negotiating style and strategy.

00:17:16.917 --> 00:17:19.393
JB: I used to be a hard-line negotiator,

00:17:19.417 --> 00:17:22.833
and now what I strive for
is to be a creative negotiator.

00:17:24.083 --> 00:17:26.851
AG: Jason and Grace
started at opposite extremes.

00:17:26.875 --> 00:17:29.684
He was a steamroller
who was all about results.

00:17:29.708 --> 00:17:33.059
She was a pushover
who was all about relationships,